  "conditions": [
    "Normal emulator application restart with empty decks",
    "Exact isolated macvlan/TAP namespace; each socket bound to its matching real virtual Ethernet MAC",
    "Provider startup staggered5 seconds",
    "Every provider uses an independent read-only FixtureFiles instance, including valid PDB/audio virtual tree"
