  "observations": [
    "v37 concurrent startup still shows incomplete/mismatched source rows despite corrected Ethernet MACs",
    "v38 staggered startup with three empty file stubs shows consistent providers1..3 but missing4",
    "v39 staggered startup with real file backend for every provider shows all four native Source rows",
    "Reviewed Browse headers/computer icons and counts match provider1=101,2=202,3=303,4=404 tracks; no result is inferred from filenames alone",
    "Each provider receives native setup/menu/render requests on its own endpoint"
  ],
